<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia budget sets up low rates for years - PM.</title>
<headline>Australia budget sets up low rates for years - PM.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Prime Minister John Howard said on Wednesday the government's 1997/98 budget set the country up for low interest rates for years to come.</p>
<p>&quot;It will set this country up for sustained economic growth and low inflation and low interest rates for years into the future,&quot; Howard told radio 2GB.</p>
</text>
